  "_comment": [
    "Per-team TimePad configuration.",
    "XACA-0619 — TimePad per-team config foundation (child of EPIC-0039).",
    "",
    "REBRAND NOTE: This file supersedes the retired legacy time-tracking config (hard cutover).",
    "The canonical API host is https://timepad.io/api. The retired legacy host is not valid here.",
    "",
    "TOKEN SECURITY: The 'tokenRef' field holds ONLY a reference name (env-var or vault key).",
    "A raw token value MUST NEVER appear in this file. The loader (XACA-0619-002) resolves",
    "the actual token at runtime via the XACA-0279 vault-primary + env-failover chain.",
    "",
    "ENABLE/DISABLE: The enable gate is NOT stored here. It lives in the board JSON at",
    "teamConfig.timepadSupport.enabled (served by /api/team-config, mirrors crSupport).",
    "This is the single source of truth — see docs/TIMEPAD_CONFIG.md.",
    "",
    "PLACEHOLDER VALUES: All UUID fields (clientId, projectId, tagId) below contain",
    "placeholder strings. The UUIDs from any prior host database are INVALID — they were",
    "issued by a retired service and will not resolve against timepad.io. You MUST",
    "fetch real IDs from https://timepad.io/api before these blocks are usable.",
    "See docs/TIMEPAD_CONFIG.md for fetch instructions."
  ],
